2One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ylj8J%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"sMEuG\" id=\"sMEuG\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5cde92d8\" id=\"u5cde92d8\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">3.3 Spring中的字段注入</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"YeG9q\" id=\"YeG9q\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueea8f4df\" id=\"ueea8f4df\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">示例代码</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation.Autowired%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.context.annotation.ComponentScan%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.context.annotation.Configuration%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.stereotype.Component%3B%5Cn%40Component%5Cnclass%20ServiceA%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20Service%20implementation%5Cn%7D%5Cn%40Component%5Cnclass%20ServiceB%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40Autowired%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20ServiceA%20serviceA%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20void%20performTask()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20Use%20serviceA%20to%20perform%20some%20task%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20System.out.println(this.serviceA)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cIoeT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"e63ca871\" id=\"e63ca871\"><br></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u9d14f7ff\" id=\"u9d14f7ff\"><br></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 440, "description": "依赖注入（Dependency Injection, DI）是软件开发中的一种设计模式，它可以使代码更加松耦合、便于测试和维护。在Java开发中，尤其是在Spring框架中，依赖注入扮演着非常重要的角色。1. 什么是依赖注入依赖注入是一种设计模式，其核心思想是将对象的创建和对其依赖的管理交给外...", "updated_at": "2025-05-18T13:13:30.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:00.000Z", "id": 216261306, "status": 1}